                                    <pre><code><span class="dax-measure">EV Count</span> <span class="dax-operator">=</span> <span class="dax-function">CALCULATE</span>( [Qty Sold], <span class="dax-function">FILTER</span>('dimModel', <span class="dax-function">CONTAINSSTRING</span>('dimModel'[Model], <span class="dax-string">"BMW i"</span>)))</code></pre>
